ice_v3.2.0-1.17%2B.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryguy2k4/ryguy2k4endpractice/tarball/v3.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryguy2k4/ryguy2k4endpractice/zipball/v3.2.0","body":"The map now has a version for 1.15! A key issue was that the structure size in 1.15 is 32x32x32, while in 1.16 it was 48x48x48, which required the island reset mechanism to be redone more efficiently. I plan on making a quick tutorial video on the map, especially focusing on the saving heights menu. The 1.15 version likely has bugs in it still so please DM me at ryguy2k4#9371 with any bugs, qol improvements, or feature requests. Also, the 1.15 map has different end islands. The default one is the current 1.9-1.15 SSG seed and the second is the previous SSG seed. I'm looking to add 3 more seeds at some point, so let me know if there are any iconic seeds on that version that I could use.\r\n\r\n### **Changelog**\r\n- Simplified and reduced redundancy in island loading mechanism to enable an easier port to 1.15\r\n- Several changes to allow parity with the 1.15 version of the map\r\n  - Removing 1.16 items from the chest menu\r\n  - Replacing respawn anchor sound with anvil sound\r\n  - Changing hex colors to color names\r\n- Added option for facing direction in each fountain preset\r\n- Moved reset signs down a block to allow for old fashioned block/slab setups\r\n- Added reset egg to one cycle practice\r\n- Minor Bug Fix: Edge of island spawn for Gravel SSG was 1 block too low\r\n- Minor Bug Fix: Typo, failed was spelt falied"}